  DisplayName: Tiffin Box Deliverer
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Access Tian Xia origin Known to some as a dabbawala, you work for
    a delivery service, delivering and returning sturdy tiffins with hardy lunches
    for those who can't afford to bring lunch with them on their morning commute.
    Maybe you saw something you shouldn't have while out on your deliveries. Maybe
    you want more than just a mundane life. Either way, you know to prepare a lunch
    or two for your future adventures. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to
    Dexterity or Intelligence , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained
    in Society and Labor Lore. You gain the Streetwise skill feat.
